; The letter-to-sound rules of phonetok, read by every port (Python, Go, Rust).
; One rule per line:  LEFT[MATCH]RIGHT=PHONES   - the first rule of a letter to fit wins.
; Context symbols:  # one or more vowels   : zero or more consonants   ^ one consonant   . one voiced consonant
;                   + one front vowel (e i y)   & a sibilant   @ t s r d l z n j th ch sh   % a suffix   (space) the word's edge
; A vowel carries a stress digit only where the rule knows it (AH0 is a schwa); the stress of the rest is
; assigned afterwards.  Lines starting with ; are comments.  Leading spaces are significant.
; --- A ----------------------------------------------------------------------
[A] =AH0
 [ARE] =AA R
 [AR]O=AH0 R
[AR]#=EH R
^[AS]#=EY S
[A]WA=AH0
[AW]=AO
